---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>🔬 Siriyak CR</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome to my professional portfolio. I am a Biostatistician and Clinical Research professional focused on 
				optimizing drug development through end-to-end automation.
			</p>
			<p>
				My primary project is the <strong>Clinical Trial Automation Framework</strong>—an R-based solution 
				that reduces phase 3 data analysis timelines from <strong>8 weeks to just 1 day</strong>. 
				This framework achieves ~97% automation coverage across the entire clinical trial lifecycle.
			</p>
			<h2>🚀 Key Expertise</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>CDISC Standards</strong>: SDTM and ADaM automated generation and validation.</li>
				<li><strong>Statistical Computing</strong>: Advanced R programming for clinical trial reporting.</li>
				<li><strong>Clinical Data Intelligence</strong>: Real-time monitoring and Risk-Based Monitoring (RBM).</li>
				<li><strong>Regulatory Compliance</strong>: FDA, EMA, and PMDA submission readiness.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Check out my <a href="/blog">blog</a> for technical deep-dives into the framework architecture, 
				or visit the <a href="/about">About</a> page to view my resumes and professional experience.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
